&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136018/lego-ideas-backlog"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: X-wing Starfighter &amp; Yavin 4</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136033</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136033</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/9677-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: X-wing Starfighter &amp; Yavin 4"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/9677-1'&gt;9677&lt;/a&gt; X-wing Starfighter &amp; Yavin 4, released during 2012. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Star-Wars/year-2012'&gt;38 Star Wars sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/9677-1'&gt;77 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-9677-1'&gt;1 minifig&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$9.99 / £9.99, which equates to about US$14 / £14 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 11,962 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=9677-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=9677-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $22.50,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=9677-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136033/random-set-of-the-day-x-wing-starfighter-yavin-4"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>LEGO Super Mario Yoshi set teased</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136026</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136026</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136026_55642477918_4e694d6fab_c.jpg' alt="LEGO Super Mario Yoshi set teased"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Eagle-eyed Adam over at &lt;a href="https://bricksfanz.com/new-lego-super-mario-yoshi-set-teased/"&gt;BricksFanz&lt;/a&gt; spotted this teaser for a large-scale model of Yoshi in the Nintendo Today app this morning.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It&amp;#39;ll join Mario, Luigi, Bowser and the Piranha Plant in the range of brick-built Super Mario characters that have been released so far. We anticipate that it&amp;#39;ll be available early in the New Year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 21:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>BrickLink downtime continues</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136025</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136025</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136025_maintenance_parrot.jpg' alt="BrickLink downtime continues"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;As you may have noticed, BrickLink has been down since late last week, and it&amp;#39;s just been announced that it will remain offline until at least Wednesday evening.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;That impacts us here because we hot link to minifigure images on the BrickLink server, which is why our listings are not currently showing them, and we also uses its API to gather prices and availability of sets, parts, and minifigs.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;No announcement, or indeed any communication at all, has been made about why it&amp;#39;s been offline for so long, so we will have to draw our own conclusions. I guess it&amp;#39;s possible that the recent well publicised PHP issues have something to do with it.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In the meantime, the independent LEGO marketplace &lt;a href="https://brickowl.com?utm_source=brickset"&gt;BrickOwl&lt;/a&gt; remains online and ready to sate your ABS cravings.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Are you a buyer or a seller affected by the outage? What do you make of it?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 18:17:29 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Competition: Build a Restaurant of the World</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136015</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136015</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136015_row.jpg' alt="Competition: Build a Restaurant of the World"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;It&amp;#39;s been five years since we last held a building competition, so it&amp;#39;s high time we arranged another one!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/subtheme-Restaurants-of-the-World/theme-Promotional"&gt;four Restaurants of the World&lt;/a&gt; that were offered as gifts with purchase during the year were great fun and well received. We want you to build one in the same style. Simple as that.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Your model should:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Be built on a 10x12 stud base&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Have a single-storey building that&amp;#39;s 8x10 in size&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Be open at the back&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Have an oversized representation of the food that&amp;#39;s being sold on the roof&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Optionally include a minifig&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Not use AI to enhance its appearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You could make a seaside fish and chip shop, an ice cream parlour, coffee booth, or perhaps something that&amp;#39;s common in your country: it&amp;#39;s entirely up to you!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We encourage you to build with real bricks, but digital entries will be accepted, as long as they could be built in real life. Feel free to add &amp;#39;stickers&amp;#39; for the sign/menu etc.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Entries will be judged on their originality, how well they capture the essence of the location and/or the food they are selling, use of the space and, of course, the design of the rooftop appendage.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Three prizes will be awarded, with the grand prize being &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/11387-1"&gt;11387&lt;/a&gt; Holiday House. Second and third prizes will be announced later.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To enter, add your entry to the group on &lt;a href="https://www.flickr.com/groups/14895961@N25/pool/"&gt;Flickr&lt;/a&gt;, upload to Instagram with the hashtag #bricksetrowcompetition, or email your entry to competition@brickset.com by Monday, 30th November.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>First 2026 Ideas review period results announced</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136017</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136017</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/131817_ideas2026.jpg' alt="First 2026 Ideas review period results announced"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;The results of the first 2026 review period have been announced.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Three projects from the 97 were successful, and two have been added to the parking lot, pending a decision.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Find out which ones prevailed after the break.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136017/first-2026-ideas-review-period-results-announced"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Old GWPs return to LEGO.com</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136011</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136011</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/40906-1.jpg' alt="Old GWPs return to LEGO.com"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;While we await the availability of new GWPs at LEGO.com later in the month, several that were available earlier in the year have returned:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In the UK and Europe:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40906-1"&gt;40906&lt;/a&gt; Restaurants of the World: Japan free with purchases over &amp;pound;160 / $180 until the 15th of November&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;in the USA:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40886-1"&gt;40886&lt;/a&gt; Penguins in Love free when you spend over $100 / CA$130 before the 15th November&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In Australia:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40768-1"&gt;40768&lt;/a&gt; Star Trek: Type-15 Shuttlepod free when you buy &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10356-1"&gt;10356&lt;/a&gt; Star Trek: U.S.S. Enterprise NCC-1701-D until the 20th November&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In New Zealand:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40908-1"&gt;40908&lt;/a&gt; Restaurants of the World: Greece free when you spend over &amp;pound;320 until 15th November&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40768-1"&gt;40768&lt;/a&gt; Star Trek: Type-15 Shuttlepod free when you buy &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10356-1"&gt;10356&lt;/a&gt; Star Trek: U.S.S. Enterprise NCC-1701-D until the 20th November&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Additionally, everywhere:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/30720-1"&gt;30720&lt;/a&gt; Ariel &amp;amp; Flounder&amp;#39;s Birthday Music Fun free when spending over &amp;pound;35 / &amp;euro;40 / &amp;pound;40 on Disney sets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="/click?r=1109"&gt;Shop now &amp;raquo;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 09:10:32 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: TIE Advanced Prototype</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136009</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136009</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/30275-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: TIE Advanced Prototype"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/30275-1'&gt;30275&lt;/a&gt; TIE Advanced Prototype, released during 2015. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Star-Wars/year-2015'&gt;70 Star Wars sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/30275-1'&gt;47 pieces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 6,507 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=30275-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=30275-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $5.90,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=30275-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136009/random-set-of-the-day-tie-advanced-prototype"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Recent reviews</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136008</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136008</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;These are the reviews that we've published recently:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class='reviewlist'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/72161-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/133777'&gt;72161 Drone Search for Mythical Mew&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;Discover a rare Pokémon behind a clever little game&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/75642-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135711'&gt;75642 Showdown with Captain Smoker&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;There is little included for such a high price, but the minifigures in particular are superb&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/40874-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135696'&gt;40874 Santa's Holiday Countdown&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;A well-built Santa and chimney diorama, with a somewhat pointless countdown feature.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/42705-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135584'&gt;42705 Cosy Autumn Forest Cabin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;A larger autumnal scene with fun moving functions &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/40898-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135718'&gt;40898 Venetian Water Taxi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;A nice addition to the Venetian scene but not an essential one&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/11388-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135635'&gt;11388 Venetian Neighbourhood&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;A sizeable and detailed model but its overall appearance is let down by some questionable architectural choices&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/news/category-Set-review'&gt;View more reviews in the news archive »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 23:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>This week's top news articles</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135996</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135996</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://brickset.com/assets/images/logo/logo.png' alt="This week's top news articles"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;These are the most read articles that we've posted during the last fortnight:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class='neattable'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Article&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Date&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Views&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Likes&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Comments&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135635/review-11388-venetian-neighbourhood'&gt;Review: 11388 Venetian Neighbourhood&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;25 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;12706&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;178&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;88&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135900/21375-godzilla-the-biggest-ever-lego-ideas-set-revealed!'&gt;21375 Godzilla, the biggest ever LEGO Ideas set, revealed!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;03 Nov&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;12490&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;103&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;190&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135732/lego-marvel-what-if--sanctum-sanctorum-revealed!'&gt;LEGO Marvel What If...? Sanctum Sanctorum revealed!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;28 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;10898&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;99&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;80&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135941/first-images-of-2027-lego-botanicals-sets!'&gt;First images of 2027 LEGO Botanicals sets!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;06 Nov&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;9155&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;129&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;39&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135844/technic-42254-solar-system-planets-in-orbit-official-images!'&gt;Technic 42254 Solar System Planets in Orbit official images!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;01 Nov&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;7412&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;122&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;78&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135947/lego-ninjago-71888-ivo-s-ninja-dojo-revealed!'&gt;LEGO NINJAGO 71888 Ivo's Ninja Dojo revealed!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;06 Nov&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;7359&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;127&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;74&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135699/11388-venetian-neighbourhood-minifigures'&gt;11388 Venetian Neighbourhood minifigures&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;26 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;7222&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;116&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;43&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135953/2027-chinese-festival-sets-revealed'&gt;2027 Chinese Festival sets revealed&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;06 Nov&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;6669&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;110&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;34&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135733/three-2027-lego-friends-sets-announced!'&gt;Three 2027 LEGO Friends sets announced!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;28 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;6452&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;78&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;56&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135963/six-more-botanical-sets-for-2027-revealed!'&gt;Six more Botanical sets for 2027 revealed!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;06 Nov&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;5937&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;111&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;41&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;The total number of news article views this week is 155,867, which is 23,219 more than last week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 10:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: Hydraxon</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135993</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135993</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/8923-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: Hydraxon"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/8923-1'&gt;8923&lt;/a&gt; Hydraxon, released during 2007. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Bionicle/year-2007'&gt;31 Bionicle sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/8923-1'&gt;165 pieces&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$19.99 / £14.99, which equates to about US$30 / £24 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 1,815 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=8923-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=8923-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $382.60,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=8923-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135993/random-set-of-the-day-hydraxon"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: twn290</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135992</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135992</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/twn290.png' alt="Random figure of the day: twn290"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/twn290'&gt;twn290&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Mom, Medium Lavender Jacket over Lavender Shirt, Dark Tan Legs, Black Hair&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-Town'&gt;Town&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/10257-1'&gt;10257&lt;/a&gt; Carousel, released during 2017.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 41,065 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=twn290&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=twn290'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $5.40.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135992/random-figure-of-the-day-twn290"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 02:01:03 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>What's hot this week</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135991</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135991</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://brickset.com/assets/images/logo/logo.png' alt="What's hot this week"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;These are the sets that have been viewed the most this week:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class='neattable'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th class='textcenter'&gt;TW&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th class='textcenter'&gt;LW&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Set&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Views&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/40865-1/Buddy-the-Elf'&gt;40865&lt;/a&gt; Buddy the Elf&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;4673&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;darr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/40889-1/Build-Paint-and-Play!'&gt;40889&lt;/a&gt; Build, Paint and Play!&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;3047&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;20&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;uarr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/40898-1/Venetian-Water-Taxi'&gt;40898&lt;/a&gt; Venetian Water Taxi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2739&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/42254-1/Solar-System-Planets-in-Orbit'&gt;42254&lt;/a&gt; Solar System Planets in Orbit&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2504&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/21375-1/Godzilla'&gt;21375&lt;/a&gt; Godzilla&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2255&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;5&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;darr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/75192-1/Millennium-Falcon'&gt;75192&lt;/a&gt; Millennium Falcon&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2109&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/112507-1/Rogue-vs-Zarkt'&gt;112507&lt;/a&gt; Rogue vs. Zarkt&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2099&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;darr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/11388-1/Venetian-Neighbourhood'&gt;11388&lt;/a&gt; Venetian Neighbourhood&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2014&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;9&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/42179-1/Planet-Earth-and-Moon-in-Orbit'&gt;42179&lt;/a&gt; Planet Earth and Moon in Orbit&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1861&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;darr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/76294-1/X-Men-The-X-Mansion'&gt;76294&lt;/a&gt; X-Men: The X-Mansion&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1743&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;The total number of set detail pages viewed this week is 1,900,339, which is 200,589 more than last week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 23:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Review: 72161 Drone Search for Mythical Mew</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/133777</link><author>SetToBuild</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/133777</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/133777_72161-005_0348.jpg' alt="Review: 72161 Drone Search for Mythical Mew"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Long before Grogu, another cute, rare, powerful, and seemingly ageless creature was sought after for its special properties&amp;mdash;in the hopes of engineering &lt;a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mewtwo"&gt;ultimate beings&lt;/a&gt;. With this set, you too can search for such a mythical marvel, but hopefully for some less nefarious purposes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Back in my day, &lt;a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mew_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"&gt;Mew&lt;/a&gt; was a schoolyard legend, as finding it needed a glitchy miracle, and the process was not a simple internet search away! Now kids can just use a drone&amp;mdash;and a surprisingly fun one at that!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note, this set does not contain a SMART Brick.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/133777/review-72161-drone-search-for-mythical-mew"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Which is the best modular building?</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135979</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135979</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135935_mbc.jpg' alt="Which is the best modular building?"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;The first phase of our quest to determine your favourite modular building is complete.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Over 4,000 votes were cast in our poll which was used to whittle down 21 contenders to just eight. Those eight are as follows, grouped in seeded pairs for the quarter-finals of the knockout phase of the contest:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10255-1"&gt;10255&lt;/a&gt; Assembly Square&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10251-1"&gt;10251&lt;/a&gt; Brick Bank&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10297-1"&gt;10297&lt;/a&gt; Boutique Hotel&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10350-1"&gt;10350&lt;/a&gt; Tudor Corner&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10260-1"&gt;10260&lt;/a&gt; Downtown Diner&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10246-1"&gt;10246&lt;/a&gt; Detective&amp;#39;s Office&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10326-1"&gt;10326&lt;/a&gt; Natural History Museum&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10243-1"&gt;10243&lt;/a&gt; Parisian Restaurant&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The next stage will hopefully commence on Monday with the first two of the four quarter-final contests. But we need your help: we need people to advocate for them, to write a paragraph or two about why people should vote for their set rather than their competitor. If you&amp;#39;d like to do so, just drop a note in the comments stating which one you&amp;#39;d like to advocate for and I&amp;#39;ll be in touch.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&amp;#39;ve listed the unsuccessful buildings and the number of votes they received after the break. I&amp;#39;m a little surprised that the latest one didn&amp;#39;t get much love...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135979/which-is-the-best-modular-building"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Vintage set of the week: Excavator</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135976</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135976</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/604-2.jpg' alt="Vintage set of the week: Excavator"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;This week's vintage set is &lt;a href='/sets/604-2'&gt;604&lt;/a&gt; Excavator, released during 1971. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-LEGOLAND/year-1971'&gt;27 LEGOLAND sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/604-2/rebrickable'&gt;22 pieces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 719 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you might find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=604-2&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=604-2#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=604-2'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135976/vintage-set-of-the-week-excavator"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: sw0979</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135975</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135975</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/sw0979.png' alt="Random figure of the day: sw0979"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/sw0979'&gt;sw0979&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Aldar Beedo - One Piece (4143266)&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-Star-Wars'&gt;Star Wars&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/7186-1'&gt;7186&lt;/a&gt; Watto's Junkyard, released during 2001.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 2,787 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=sw0979&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=sw0979'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $151.40.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135975/random-figure-of-the-day-sw0979"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 02:01:03 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Six more Botanical sets for 2027 revealed!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135963</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135963</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/11533-1.jpg' alt="Six more Botanical sets for 2027 revealed!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Following the &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135941/first-images-of-2027-lego-botanicals-sets!"&gt;unveiling of four 2027 Botanical sets&lt;/a&gt; earlier today, six more have been revealed at LEGO.com.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;These are a bit different, though: they are small models at pocket-money prices (&amp;pound;4.49, $4.99, &amp;euro;4.99) that are packaged in collectable minifigure sized boxes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;View photos of all six blooms after the break.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135963/six-more-botanical-sets-for-2027-revealed!"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>2027 Chinese Festival sets revealed</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135953</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135953</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/80123-1.jpg' alt="2027 Chinese Festival sets revealed"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;LEGO has revealed next year&amp;#39;s Spring Festival sets at the annual China International Import Expo that&amp;#39;s currently underway in Shanghai.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/80122-1"&gt;80122&lt;/a&gt; Auspicious Pixiu Under Fortune Tree features the mythical creature who is commonly associated with attracting and protecting wealth, while &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/80123-1"&gt;80123&lt;/a&gt; Spring Festival Voyage includes a family taking to the water in a traditional sailing vessel accompanied by a Year of the Goat minifigure.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;As is always the case with the Chinese festival sets, they are good value for money.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;View more pictures after the break&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135953/2027-chinese-festival-sets-revealed"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>LEGO Prosperity Lion gift-with-purchase announced!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135948</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135948</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135948_40976_Prod_rC3y2NLYdg6x.jpg' alt="LEGO Prosperity Lion gift-with-purchase announced!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40976-1/Prosperity-Lion"&gt;40976&lt;/a&gt; Prosperity Lion has been announced at the annual China International Import Expo, as a LEGO.com gift-with-purchase to be released on January 1st.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The set contains 411 pieces and is the latest of several sets based on the traditional lion dance that forms part of Lunar New Year celebrations. The purchase threshold to qualify for this gift-with-purchase is not yet known, but we hope to have more information soon.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; LEGO.com seems to suggest this set will actually be available to buy, costing &amp;pound;26.99, $29.99 or &amp;euro;29.99, but the information we were supplied in advance definitely identified it as a gift-with-purchase, so we await confirmation either way.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;View more images below...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135948/lego-prosperity-lion-gift-with-purchase-announced!"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 05:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>LEGO NINJAGO 71888 Ivo's Ninja Dojo revealed!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135947</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135947</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135947_71888_Prod_HjguBvfr9SvD.jpg' alt="LEGO NINJAGO 71888 Ivo's Ninja Dojo revealed!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;NINJAGO includes some wonderful larger models and another has been unveiled today, arriving on January 1st! The press release for Ivo&amp;#39;s Ninja Dojo follows:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/71888-1/Ivo-s-Ninja-Dojo"&gt;71888&lt;/a&gt; Ivo&amp;#39;s Ninja Dojo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Rated 14+, 3,495 pieces&lt;br /&gt;
$279.99 / &amp;pound;249.99 / &amp;euro;279.99&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/click/?s=71888"&gt;Available at LEGO.com&lt;/a&gt; from 1st January&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Rise to the challenge of constructing this stunningly detailed LEGO NINJAGO Ivo&amp;rsquo;s Ninja Dojo collectable building toy from the NINJAGO Legends Embers + Ashes TV series, then explore the expansive interior&amp;rsquo;s many surprises.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Remove levels to find hidden references, elemental lanterns, and more. Take advantage of falling parts and fighting mechanisms to defeat opponents, then ride off in victory on the hoverbike.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Create an epic battle scene with 12 NINJAGO character minifigures. Equip Jin, Mira, Nate, Tre, Master Ivo, Master Zane, Gigi, Duncan, Oni Imperator, Oni Warrior, and Madge and Roland with swords, nunchucks, sai, a claw, and spears for the ultimate fantasy decor.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135947/lego-ninjago-71888-ivo-s-ninja-dojo-revealed!"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 03:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: First Order Special Forces TIE Fighter</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135951</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135951</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/75101-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: First Order Special Forces TIE Fighter"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/75101-1'&gt;75101&lt;/a&gt; First Order Special Forces TIE Fighter, released during 2015. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Star-Wars/year-2015'&gt;70 Star Wars sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/75101-1'&gt;517 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-75101-1'&gt;4 minifigs&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$69.99 / £64.99, which equates to about US$95 / £90 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 17,244 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=75101-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=75101-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $86.50,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=75101-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135951/random-set-of-the-day-first-order-special-forces-tie-fighter"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: cty1245</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135950</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135950</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/cty1245.png' alt="Random figure of the day: cty1245"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/cty1245'&gt;cty1245&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Woman - Bright Light Blue Hoodie over Dark Purple Star Shirt, Sand Blue Legs, Reddish Brown Hair, Baby Carrier&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-Town'&gt;Town&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/60292-1'&gt;60292&lt;/a&gt; Town Centre, released during 2021.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 2,892 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=cty1245&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=cty1245'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $5.10.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135950/random-figure-of-the-day-cty1245"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 02:01:04 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>First images of 2027 LEGO Botanicals sets!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135941</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135941</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135941_11519_Prod_IIVIm0yPCWaA.jpg' alt="First images of 2027 LEGO Botanicals sets!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Four new Botanicals sets have been announced, with three arriving on January 1st and another in February.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The highlight among them is perhaps &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/11519-1/Wild-Orchid"&gt;11519&lt;/a&gt; Wild Orchid, which reminds me of the exceptional &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/11505-1/Woodland-Mushrooms"&gt;11505&lt;/a&gt; Woodland Mushrooms launched earlier this year and makes fantastic use of purple seal elements! All four sets look superb though, making full use of the wide variety of foliage elements available.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;View the new sets after the break...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135941/first-images-of-2027-lego-botanicals-sets!"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 00:00:01 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Poll: Which is your favourite modular building?</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135935</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135935</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135935_mbc.jpg' alt="Poll: Which is your favourite modular building?"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;It&amp;#39;s approaching the time of year when the next modular building will be revealed, so ahead of that we are going to find out which one of the &lt;a href='http://brickset.com/sets/subtheme-Modular-Buildings-Collection'&gt;21 released so far&lt;/a&gt; you think is the best.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This is how it will work. First, we will conduct a poll to whittle the 21 down to eight. The eight with the highest number of votes will then compete in a three-round knockout phase, which we like to call &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/news/category-Brickset-Bouts'&gt;Brickset bouts&lt;/a&gt;, to determine the overall winner. We considered starting with 16 and having four rounds, but that would drag on too long.As we have done in previous bouts, we will ask if you&amp;#39;d like to advocate for one of the contenders during the knockout phase, to &amp;#39;big it up&amp;#39; against its rival, so have a think about whether that&amp;#39;s something you&amp;#39;d like to do.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So, without further ado, please pick your favourite modular building from the list below:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;form class='form'&gt;&lt;fieldset&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Which is your favourite Modular Building?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class='row' id='option135935'&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10182-1'&gt;10182&lt;/a&gt; Cafe Corner"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10182-1'&gt;10182&lt;/a&gt; Cafe Corner&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10190-1'&gt;10190&lt;/a&gt; Market Street"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10190-1'&gt;10190&lt;/a&gt; Market Street&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10185-1'&gt;10185&lt;/a&gt; Green Grocer"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10185-1'&gt;10185&lt;/a&gt; Green Grocer&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10197-1'&gt;10197&lt;/a&gt; Fire Brigade"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10197-1'&gt;10197&lt;/a&gt; Fire Brigade&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10211-1'&gt;10211&lt;/a&gt; Grand Emporium"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10211-1'&gt;10211&lt;/a&gt; Grand Emporium&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10218-1'&gt;10218&lt;/a&gt; Pet Shop"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10218-1'&gt;10218&lt;/a&gt; Pet Shop&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10224-1'&gt;10224&lt;/a&gt; Town Hall"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10224-1'&gt;10224&lt;/a&gt; Town Hall&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10232-1'&gt;10232&lt;/a&gt; Palace Cinema"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10232-1'&gt;10232&lt;/a&gt; Palace Cinema&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10243-1'&gt;10243&lt;/a&gt; Parisian Restaurant"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10243-1'&gt;10243&lt;/a&gt; Parisian Restaurant&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10246-1'&gt;10246&lt;/a&gt; Detective&amp;#39;s Office"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10246-1'&gt;10246&lt;/a&gt; Detective&amp;#39;s Office&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10251-1'&gt;10251&lt;/a&gt; Brick Bank"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10251-1'&gt;10251&lt;/a&gt; Brick Bank&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10255-1'&gt;10255&lt;/a&gt; Assembly Square"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10255-1'&gt;10255&lt;/a&gt; Assembly Square&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10260-1'&gt;10260&lt;/a&gt; Downtown Diner"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10260-1'&gt;10260&lt;/a&gt; Downtown Diner&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10264-1'&gt;10264&lt;/a&gt; Corner Garage"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10264-1'&gt;10264&lt;/a&gt; Corner Garage&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10270-1'&gt;10270&lt;/a&gt; Bookshop"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10270-1'&gt;10270&lt;/a&gt; Bookshop&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10278-1'&gt;10278&lt;/a&gt; Police Station"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10278-1'&gt;10278&lt;/a&gt; Police Station&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10297-1'&gt;10297&lt;/a&gt; Boutique Hotel"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10297-1'&gt;10297&lt;/a&gt; Boutique Hotel&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10312-1'&gt;10312&lt;/a&gt; Jazz Club"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10312-1'&gt;10312&lt;/a&gt; Jazz Club&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10326-1'&gt;10326&lt;/a&gt; Natural History Museum"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10326-1'&gt;10326&lt;/a&gt; Natural History Museum&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10350-1'&gt;10350&lt;/a&gt; Tudor Corner"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/10350-1'&gt;10350&lt;/a&gt; Tudor Corner&lt;br/&gt;

&lt;input type='radio' name='poll135935' value="&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/11371-1'&gt;11371&lt;/a&gt; Shopping Street"&gt; &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/11371-1'&gt;11371&lt;/a&gt; Shopping Street&lt;br/&gt;

